    "name": "Preliminary Estimates of the Potential for Carbon Mitigation in European Soils Through No-Till Farming",
    "description": [
      "in this paper we estimate the European potential for carbon mitigation of no-till farming using results from European tillage experiments. Our calculations suggest some potential in terms of (a) reduced agricultural fossil fuel emissions, and (b) increased soil carbon sequestration. We estimate that 100% conversion to no-till farming would be likely to sequester about 23 Tg C y",
